      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Brace the Tail</h1><p><em>The tail presses into the bottom and holds the body against the current.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-marsh-crocodile-brace-the-tail</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>While touching the bed or bank, gain Stability 2 until its next turn; highest source only.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
